            全平台翻墙客户端新手与进阶配置中心
          </h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/guides/" class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 hover:underline">
          浏览全平台 30 篇教程手册 →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
        <a href="/guides/windows/" class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">💻</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Windows 电脑配置</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Clash Verge Rev 现代版、v2rayN 深度调优与 Tun 虚拟网卡游戏加速。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 mt-4">查看 Windows 教程 →</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/guides/android/" class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📱</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Android 安卓手机</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Clash Meta (CMFA) 分应用代理绕过微信、v2rayNG 轻量省电教程。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 mt-4">查看 Android 教程 →</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/guides/ios/" class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🍏</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">iOS 苹果设备</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Shadowrocket 小火箭海外下载、Stash 与 Quantumult X 策略组配置。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 mt-4">查看 iOS 教程 →</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/guides/router-bypass/" class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🌐</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">软路由与旁路网关</h3>
